# Packed tarballs for testing a consumer against unpublished packages (`pnpm pack`).
.packed/

# The private product vocabulary the publishability test reads
# (tests/architecture/publishability.test.ts). Never committed.
.private-vocabulary

# Written by `next dev` when it detects a coding agent; the reference app
# is the CLI's output and carries neither.
apps/app/AGENTS.md
apps/app/CLAUDE.md
